{"attribution":"Federal Trade Commission, How To Spot, Avoid, and Report Identity Theft, Simplified Chinese, November 2023; no FTC endorsement or affiliation is implied.","cases":[{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-001","input":"身份盗窃是指有人在未经您许可的情况下使用您的个人或财务信息。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-001","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-002","input":"是否发现您没有购买物品的费用？","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-002","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-003","input":"留意您的银行账户对账单。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-003","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-004","input":"是否有您不知晓的取款？","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-004","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-005","input":"是否有让您觉得意外的变化？","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-005","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-006","input":"查看您的邮件。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-006","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-007","input":"您是否收不到某个账单了？","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-007","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-008","input":"您是否收到了您从未开立过账户的账单？","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-008","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-009","input":"或者收到来自您不认识雇主的信？","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-009","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-010","input":"身份盗窃可能发生在任何人身上。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-010","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-011","input":"将您的出生证明、社会保障卡和账户对账单等正式文件保存在安全的地方。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-011","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-012","input":"在扔掉任何显示您个人信息的文件之前，先将文件粉碎。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-012","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-013","input":"不要与突然意外联系您的人分享您的社会保障号码。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-013","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-014","input":"即使这些人自称是社会保障局、美国国税局、您的银行或您认识的其他组织的工作人员，也不要告诉他们您的个人信息。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-014","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-015","input":"保护您的网上和手机上的信息。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-015","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-016","input":"使用难以猜到的密码。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-016","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-017","input":"为提供多重身份验证功能的帐户添加多重身份验证，例如通过短信获取访问代码。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-017","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-018","input":"查看您的账单。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-018","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-019","input":"仔细查看您未购买商品的费用或意外账单。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-019","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1/sentence-020","input":"这可能是您身份被盗窃的迹象。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/1038A-HowToSpotAvoidIDT-ChineseSimp-508.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-020","split":"handout"}}],"converter_output_used":false,"dataset":"blind-v2","id":"ftc-identity-theft-simplified-v1","input_only":true,"license":"U.S. Public Domain","modification_notice":"Extracted only complete Simplified Chinese prose sentences from the checksum-pinned FTC-authored PDF, joined PDF layout wraps, removed headings, page furniture, contact instructions, URLs, bullet glyphs, incomplete list fragments, and added input-only provenance; no images, seals, expected text, or converter output were used.","purpose":"candidate_source_pilot","review_policy":"domain_and_risk_must_be_assigned_from_input_only","source_class":"public_domain","stats":{"by_split":{"handout":20},"eligible_pending_review":20,"exclusions":{},"raw_cases":20},"upstream_revision":"FTC How To Spot, Avoid, and Report Identity Theft, Simplified Chinese, November 2023; PDF Last-Modified 2024-01-22T14:27:03Z; raw SHA-256: d1ec4c4942e12eda9e35a4b50860f43b150b